Hi Nicolás,

This should work:

ndext2<- data.frame(year =factor("01", levels=c("01", "02", "03")), NP = seq(-1.5152, 4.2756, length = 145), Properties = 0)

E.ext2 <- predict(mbest, type="ext", newdata=ndext2)

The way predict works in unmarked, you need to specify all the levels of each factor in the model, even if you only want a prediction for one level.
​This is somewhat inconvenient, and ​
I (or someone
​ else​
)
​should modify predict so that it recognizes the levels ​automatically.

Richard

