Dear Edward,

one possibility might be to define a single factor for the Treatment/Perching interaction. That factor would have 9 levels (3 x 3). Then, you use predict() with that factor and that should give you the predictions of occupancy probability for every combination of Treatment and Perching: that is what the interaction means.

Best regards  --  Marc

