Hi Sean,

Marc and Richard have a nice vignette for that here: Dynamic occupancy models in unmarked <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/unmarked/vignettes/colext.pdf>

This explains, among other things, how to get confidence intervals for back-transformed estimates.  The SE is only meaningful on the link scale.

