I am working with distance data for point counts at 350 points with one visit per year for three years.  I am mostly interested in estimating  effects of site covariates on abundance. I have some models set up and running using gdistsamp with abundance covariates and detection covariates.  But what if I want to estimates year effects on abundance--can I do this by modelling a year effect on phi?  And how would I do that because if I bring year in as a yearlySiteCovs as three columns, one for each year, there is only one class of year in each column and it doesn't the year categories will be treated correctly across all three years?  ---Frank Thompson

